# Build context hygiene.
#
# `COPY . .` used to sweep in the collected dataset and the VCS history, so
# every new Parquet file invalidated the application layer and the daemon
# received ~20 MB it never used. `bench/` must stay: the balancer image is
# also the load generator's image, and that generator runs
# bench/traffic_profiles.py. `models/` is deliberately not excluded, because
# the Phase 5 router loads its artifact from inside the image.
.git
.github
data
logs
scratch
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.venv
*.log
